{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Scanner4U 是一款專注掃描與整理文件的工具，適合需要處理收據、發票、合約、表格、課堂筆記與手冊的用戶；原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-16.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>掃描整理與編輯</h2>\n<p>Scanner4U 可為每次掃描自動建立任務，以縮圖預覽頁面，並調整對比度、亮度與色彩；即時預覽後可旋轉或裁剪頁面。匯出時一鍵分享 PDF，可選 100%、50% 或 25% 品質，也能透過系統分享選單傳送到常用應用程式。介面簡潔，提供可選格線輔助對齊，掃描內容留在裝置上，適合收據、發票、合約、表格、筆記與手冊等文件。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-5-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-6-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-7-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-8-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-9-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Scanner4U</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/scanner4u/id6758564604?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:46.741382+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":291,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T13:14:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T15:39:03.060926+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:42:01.530768+00:00","content_hash":"13b6bc9d58ad3fe216798351c4465be06115926e1e92c9791b5a01527f6a8ad4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}